				;   NOTE: this is a real call frame, not a tail-jmp. A tail `jmp` into a
				;   Win32 API quits the helper without shadow space, so the API writes its
				;   home slot over the CALLER's frame -> 0xC0000005.
				; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
